      "text": "WHAT HAPPENS NEXT\nThe uploaded record is pending. The user starts processing separately from the UI.\nEach file has independent status; failed uploads are marked through /documents/{id}/failed.\nSame-user duplicate file hashes are rejected unless the prior document failed and is being retried.",
